local.properties

# NOTE: keystore.properties is intentionally NOT ignored in this repository.
# It is committed together with the keystore so that CI can produce signed
# builds without any manual setup. This is insecure by design and only
# acceptable for a personal, self-distributed project.
# For any real release, switch to GitHub Secrets (see README) and delete both
# keystore.properties and the keystore file from the repository.

